Spec: Explicit server owner control

Purpose:
  Manage existing authenticated server device/service/grant authority from the owner tool.

Owns:
  ./OwnerControl.cs

Must:
  Accept a canonical nonnegative affected count, including zero when no prior grants require invalidation.
  Expose only the existing fixed owner methods, using the already pinned mTLS connection and server-enforced owner role.
  Require strict bounded intent JSON, explicit uint64 expected revision and stable mutation UUID; do not retry after unknown outcome.
  Validate exact correlated result shapes and report historical outcomes separately from live authority; expose no tokens or request exception details.
